  "subtitle": "Dr Renke Sabel and the Indicator Commons",
  "summary": "Dr Renke Sabel, Senior Lecturer and Convenor of the Indicator Commons, speaks for most of this short profile, which traces his interest in why an institution's indicators so seldom retire to his years in public-sector performance frameworks. Three of his Indicator Stewardship Seed Fund grants supply its examples: a dog park's incident board, a community hall's key register and a laboratory's calibration weights, each given a keeper and a successor. It also sets out his research indicators, led by a grant record no other researcher at the University matches.",
